comments:
After further discussion this morning, we decided to reduce initial scope for this to `gh pr ready` which marks a draft PR as ready for review.

We're going to punt on converting back to draft for now since that's a considerably less frequent action.

@mislav had a fantastic idea for an iteration to this which would allow for people to add reviewers when they're marking a PR as ready for review, since that's a natural associated action that you'll likely want to do. We're fine with shipping the first iteration without this, but it will be a nice followup and @ampinsk is working on designs for it.
